{
  "_doc": [
    "Conformance case table of the dimension language `coeff·sym+offset` (the source of truth for docs/ir-v2.md \"Shapes and the dimension language\").",
    "valid: canonical notation → decomposed result. Includes that a parse and format round trip is string-identical.",
    "invalid: strings that must not be accepted (non-canonical notation, multiple symbols, negative values, whitespace and so on).",
    "eval: binding table + expression → value. throws=true marks a case whose evaluation must fail.",
    "The TS implementation and the Python implementation (karume.dims) are checked against this table (the implementations hold no source of truth for the grammar)."
  ],
  "valid": [
    { "text": "T", "coeff": 1, "sym": "T", "offset": 0 },
    { "text": "2T", "coeff": 2, "sym": "T", "offset": 0 },
    { "text": "8T", "coeff": 8, "sym": "T", "offset": 0 },
    { "text": "1024T", "coeff": 1024, "sym": "T", "offset": 0 },
    { "text": "T+1", "coeff": 1, "sym": "T", "offset": 1 },
    { "text": "T+8", "coeff": 1, "sym": "T", "offset": 8 },
    { "text": "8T+2", "coeff": 8, "sym": "T", "offset": 2 },
    { "text": "16H+15", "coeff": 16, "sym": "H", "offset": 15 },
    { "text": "batch", "coeff": 1, "sym": "batch", "offset": 0 },
    { "text": "_s", "coeff": 1, "sym": "_s", "offset": 0 },
    { "text": "s0", "coeff": 1, "sym": "s0", "offset": 0 },
    { "text": "T2", "coeff": 1, "sym": "T2", "offset": 0 },
    { "text": "2T2+2", "coeff": 2, "sym": "T2", "offset": 2 },
    { "text": "seq_len", "coeff": 1, "sym": "seq_len", "offset": 0 }
  ],
  "invalid": [
